recording
- initial fields are the same as game mode
- field: game mode variant index
- repeated (count = number of bug players in the variant):
    - field (stringvar): display name
    - field: character id
    - field: deck size
    - repeated (count = deck size):
        - field: card id
- field (bytesvar): shared seed
- field: number of rounds
- repeated (count = number of rounds):
    - field: enum value representing round type:
        - CHOICE = 0
        - REALTIME = 1
    - field (bytesvar): state checksum
    - repeated (count = number of bug players in the variant):
        - field (bytesvar): personal seed
        - if round type is CHOICE:
            - field: number of cards chosen
            - repeated (count = number of cards chosen):
                - field: card index
        - if round type is REALTIME:
            - field: number of input changes in recording
            - repeated (count = number of input changes):
                - field: bitfield of input state
                - field: number of frames this state lasts for, minus one
            - field (bytesvar): personal seed after
    - if round type is REALTIME:
        - field (bytesvar): state checksum after realtime ends
- field (bytesvar): state checksum at end of match

