network protocol (finalize):
- TODO
- RELIABLE BROADCAST: if a player wants a rematch, they send a packet requesting a rematch
    - if a player sends the packet and receives it from all other players, player 1 chooses a new shared seed and then the match restarts from the deck picking phase (characters and display names stay the same; rematches variable incremented by 1)
    - if an abort is received from any player, the rematch button is disabled

